- ADR 0028 settles Settings placement, routes, pane ownership, durable/local state, compiler authority, capability-depth ownership, canonical-context resolution, typed retirement refusals, query bounds, notifications/timers, canvas layout, source-app authority, and the program ownership of `UX-00`, cohorts, thresholds, and surface-to-journey bindings.
